  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "When Fang Yuan activates Wolf Howl Gu, he emits a cry like a wolf’s howl that can be heard from eight hundred steps away. The poison beard wolves in this range turn frenzy upon hearing it, summoning twice their original battle strength. The Gu worm can increase the battle strength of wolf packs temporarily, and it is considered a precious Gu that marks its user as a rank four Gu Master.",
        "chapters": [
          438
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "sys_gu_worms",
          "sys_gu_master"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In Fang Yuan’s aperture setup, Wolf Howl Gu resides in his throat, one of several wolf-related Gu he carries in different body locations.",
        "chapters": [
          459
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "body-residence",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "In a battle near Pei tribe, Fang Yuan sits on a white eye wolf and uses Wolf Smoke Gu and Wolf Howl Gu to heal the wolf group’s wounds and increase their battle strength.",
        "chapters": [
          482
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "coordinated-offense",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_pei_tribe"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan activates rank four eagle rise Gu and flies into the sky, then unleashes Wolf Howl Gu and rank five amplify effect Gu together. He opens his mouth and howls, and his voice spreads far and wide. Under the effect of the wolf howl Gu, all his mutated beasts’ bodies expand, their eyes turn bright red, and their battle strength grows by five times.",
        "chapters": [
          533
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "amplification-interaction",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_amplify_effect_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In the final wolf tide conflict of his northern plains career, Fang Yuan gives a long howl. Amplify effect Gu at rank five and Wolf Howl Gu together cause the wolf howl to resound throughout the skies, directly suppressing all sounds from three beast groups.",
        "chapters": [
          539
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "final-conflict",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
